  "title": "UFP Industries Announces Quarterly Dividend",
  "summary": "UFP Industries, Inc. (Nasdaq: UFPI), a leading manufacturer focused on delivering value-added products is pleased to announce that its Board of Directors has declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.36 per share of common stock, payable on March 16, 2026, to shareholders of record on March 2, 2026.",
